__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"ABOUT",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return t}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"BUILT_BY",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return o}});const t=["At Prodigy Fitness, we believe that everyone has the potential to become the best version of themselves.","The word Prodigy represents a young person with exceptional ability and talent. To us, it represents potential, growth and the drive to become exceptional at what you do. Combined with our passion for fitness, this forms the foundation of Prodigy Fitness.","Our mission is to help people transform their lifestyles, build confidence and achieve their personal fitness goals. We believe fitness is about much more than simply going to the gym or changing your appearance. It's about developing discipline, building healthy habits, gaining knowledge and creating a lifestyle that you can maintain for years to come.","At Prodigy Fitness, we don't believe in quick fixes or unrealistic promises. Real results require consistency, commitment and hard work. We create individual training programmes based on each person's goals, abilities and needs, while providing the guidance, knowledge and support necessary to succeed.","We believe in a balanced approach to fitness. Discipline and dedication are essential, but so is enjoying life. You don't have to be perfect every day to make progress. It's about finding a sustainable balance that allows you to enjoy the journey while continuing to improve.","Nutrition is another important part of our philosophy. We help our clients understand nutrition, calculate their individual calorie requirements and learn how to track their food intake. Our goal is not simply to tell you what to eat, but to give you the knowledge and tools to make better decisions for yourself.","We welcome everyone, regardless of their experience or starting point. Whether your goal is to lose weight, build muscle, improve your strength or simply live a healthier lifestyle, Prodigy Fitness is here to support you.","We expect honesty, cooperation and a willingness to put in the work. We provide the guidance, but your commitment is what turns that guidance into results.","Above all, Prodigy Fitness is built on faith, with God first in everything we do. We strive to make a positive difference in people's lives by helping them grow physically, mentally and personally.","Our philosophy is simple: Never become stagnant. Always keep striving to become better than you were yesterday.","Prodigy Fitness \u2013 Become the best version of yourself."],o="Willie, the Butcher, Benadie"},1122,[]);
